[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1572.83, "timestamp": "00:26:12", "text": "B 我只是漂浮着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1577.269, "timestamp": "00:26:17", "text": "哦，你好，龙。当然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1597.63, "timestamp": "00:26:37", "text": "下午。我淘到了好多好东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1600.63, "timestamp": "00:26:40", "text": "好的。是的，这是关键策略。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1602.95, "timestamp": "00:26:42", "text": "如果你没钱，就别点赞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1605.23, "timestamp": "00:26:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1608.19, "timestamp": "00:26:48", "text": "除非你所有的客户都这样对我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1611.95, "timestamp": "00:26:51", "text": "经销商都是手动操作。就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1616.43, "timestamp": "00:26:56", "text": "更好的。你能得到很多东西，你能赚很多钱。"}]